# ---- Trained models the demo REQUIRES (exceptions to *.pt / runs/ above, so a
#      fresh clone is self-sufficient and the demo runs out of the box) ----
# The single-class door detector at the repo root:
!/best.pt
# The 4-class door verifier lives under an ignored runs/ tree, so we must re-include
# each directory on its path before we can re-include the file itself (git won't
# look inside an excluded directory). Re-include the dir, re-exclude its contents,
# then drill down — so ONLY this one weight file comes back, not the whole run.
!door_training/runs/
door_training/runs/*
!door_training/runs/detect/
door_training/runs/detect/*
!door_training/runs/detect/door_yolov8s_4cls/
door_training/runs/detect/door_yolov8s_4cls/*
!door_training/runs/detect/door_yolov8s_4cls/weights/
door_training/runs/detect/door_yolov8s_4cls/weights/*
!door_training/runs/detect/door_yolov8s_4cls/weights/best.pt
